 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In Copper Hollow, whichever animal bites you first gives you its power.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Gecko kids walk up walls. Skunk kids win every argument.",
   "tag": "[playful]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Pet shops cost more than mansions.",
   "tag": "[deadpan]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "At three, Hazel got bitten by a sloth.",
   "tag": "[amused]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "The whole school called her Slowpoke.",
   "tag": "[mocking, light]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Even her little brother, a parrot kid:",
   "tag": "[dry]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "“Slowpoke! Slowpoke!”",
   "speak": "Slowpoke! Slowpoke!",
   "voice": "bo",
   "tag": "[squawky, teasing]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet near Hazel, dodgeballs drifted like soap bubbles, and the lunch clock crawled.",
   "tag": "[curious]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Then there was Zane. A hare bit Zane, and nobody was faster.",
   "tag": "[ominous, quick]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "He zipped through lunch, snatching cookies and phones.",
   "tag": "[fast]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he grabbed Hazel's sketchbook.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "“Come get it, Slowpoke!”",
   "speak": "Come get it, Slowpoke!",
   "voice": "zane",
   "tag": "[mocking, laughing]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone laughed. Hazel glared harder than ever, and his laugh stretched like taffy.",
   "tag": "[building]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "To a sloth, the world rushes. Her power wasn't being slow. It was making things slow.",
   "tag": "[realizing]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "So she kept staring. Zane hung mid-leap, one sneaker up.",
   "tag": "[slow, amused]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Hazel strolled over and took everything back.",
   "tag": "[relaxed]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "She turned him toward the fountain, and blinked.",
   "tag": "[sly]",
   "pause": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Zane sprinted full speed, straight into the water.",
   "tag": "[gleeful]",
   "pause": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "“Take your time.”",
   "speak": "Take your time.",
   "voice": "hazel",
   "tag": "[calm, smug]",
   "pause": 0.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody calls her Slowpoke now. When Hazel walks by, everyone studies their shoes.",
   "tag": "[warm, satisfied]",
   "pause": 0.08
  }
 ],
